# 'weekly': under Pieuje, record 1 done by a claim, 3367 (weekly) taken, taken to its goal and claimed, and 129
# (accolades 10) done: the week holds a completed weekly record, 3367's progress and 10 current accolades. Logged out and
# back in over the week change: the weekly reset clears 3367's completion bit and progress (chars.eminence) and zeroes
# current_accolades. prev_accolades stays 0: the harness's chars.lastupdate is the real clock, 70 days behind the
# harness clock, so the two-weeks-offline branch zeroes it again at once.
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=30
unity Pieuje
login
record take 1
record progress 1 1
record claim 1
record take 3367
record progress 3367 1
record claim 3367
record take 129
record event LootItem itemid=13116
logout
wait jst=8
login
